    "title": "Man's legs broken by falling tree during storms in Harlem - NewsBreak",
    "text": "NEW YORK (1010 WINS) — A 43-year-old man suffered two broken legs after a tree fell on him in Harlem during the storms Monday night, authorities said. It happened at about 8:30 p.m. at the crosswalk on West 148th Street and Bradhurst Avenue, officials said. Responding firefighters could be seen the roadway pulling branches off the tree, a video posted to Citizen App shows. The man was was transported to Harlem Hospital in stable condition.",
